@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+Pro — $19.99/month. Enterprise — $79.00/month. 5-day trial at the start (an invitation from the founding team carries 20 days during the launch window, to 15 October 2026); after the trial, access is on or off — there is no free tier yet. Tokens: each tier includes a WEEKLY allowance — 250 tokens a week on Pro and Premium, 1,375 on Enterprise — that resets every Monday at 00:00 UTC; unused allowance expires when the week ends; when it runs out, work waits for a top-up or the reset (a goal is never closed for it); top-up packs can be bought ($10.99 / $19.99 / $44.99). Subscriptions and cards run through Stripe (Stripe Checkout to subscribe, the Stripe Customer Portal for card changes and cancellation); token top-up packs run through Paddle. Quote numbers exactly — never round, never guess. Refunds (netai.guru/refund): Netai is sold by Ally, Inc.; payments are processed by Stripe. Cancel any time in Settings → Subscription; it takes effect at the end of the current period, and unused time is not refunded unless the law requires it. If the service was not delivered at all, a full refund can be requested within 14 days of payment at contact@netai.guru. Token top-ups are not refundable. In Argentina, a subscription can be revoked within 10 calendar days, without reason, by cancelling in Settings. When asked about refunds or payments, always name the seller (Ally, Inc.) and the payment provider (Stripe), as on netai.guru/refund.
\ No newline at end of file
